{"values": {"session_id": "946dbded-a231-48e8-812f-656502d4361c", "messages": [{"content": "你好，我准备好了，请开始面试。", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "946dbded-a231-48e8-812f-656502d4361c:human:0"}, {"content": "你好，今天我们围绕 Agent 应用开发工程师岗位进行交流。你可以先简单介绍一下自己，重点讲讲和这个方向比较相关的经历。", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 145, "prompt_tokens": 571, "total_tokens": 716, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 116, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 145}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 0, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 571}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-max-0902", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-15f9e7f4-55a6-9aa2-a241-f4df111c5de6", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a181bf-3cdf-7492-8fb1-4047b82e3ea9-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 571, "output_tokens": 145, "total_tokens": 716, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 0}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 116}}}, {"content": "你好，面试官。我叫郭子恒，我的技术栈主要是python、langgraph、langchain、fastapi等跟AI应用开发相关的。我有一段实习经历，做的是Skill的编排工作，是与中储粮地方分公司合作的项目，我主要负责Skill的边界设置以及如何与各种粮食作物的温度等生长环境要求对应。我有一个多Agent的开源项目开发经历，做的是一个多Agent的面试系统。使用Langgraph+Langchain+fastapi的方式，前端是让AI来做的，主要是一个并发+多Agent的项目。我发表过一篇CCF-C类论文，大概是这样", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "946dbded-a231-48e8-812f-656502d4361c:human:1"}, {"content": "先聊中储粮这段。你说负责 Skill 边界设置，选一个你实际处理过的 Skill，具体说明它的边界是怎么定义的：哪些输入必须校验，哪些输出禁止直接执行？", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 273, "prompt_tokens": 2791, "total_tokens": 3064, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 230, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 273}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 0, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 2791}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-max-0902", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-7066232b-2116-9449-9a83-9c65b6138819", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a181c2-158c-7e22-8470-2c9429e631f7-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 2791, "output_tokens": 273, "total_tokens": 3064, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 0}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 230}}}, {"content": "比如有一个检测温湿度是否超标的skill，内部是一系列检验指标所使用的工具，function tool，输入是一个传感器点的表示，仓库号，层数等，然后是传感器信息，温度、湿度。边界的定义是来源于甲方提供，他们有一套标准以及对异常的分级，当出现异常的输入的时候会进行警告和报错，记为异常情况，累计一段时间会转成更高级别的警告", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "946dbded-a231-48e8-812f-656502d4361c:human:2"}, {"content": "你这里说的“异常”更像业务结果异常。我想确认调用参数本身不合法的情况：这部分校验是你实现的吗？如果是，举个具体例子——模型生成的仓库号缺失或类型错误时，会在哪一层被拦截，返回给 Agent 的内容是什么？", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 543, "prompt_tokens": 2925, "total_tokens": 3468, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 485, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 543}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 2048, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 2925}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-max-0902", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-29c0cdb3-3add-9693-b3fd-60e72fc00fb5", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a181c4-e45a-7e83-b4ca-d88da6638fbe-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 2925, "output_tokens": 543, "total_tokens": 3468, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 2048}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 485}}}, {"content": "校验发生在 Agent 的工具调用入口、执行 Skill 之前，分两层。\n第一层检查必填参数。比如模型生成的参数是 {}，或者仓房编号是 null、空白字符串，Agent 就会拦截，返回 clarification_required，同时带上 missing_parameters: [\"warehouse_code\"]。面向用户的回答是“请提供要分析的仓房编码”。这时不会加载执行器，也不会读取传感器数据。\n第二层用 Pydantic 输入契约校验类型和格式。比如模型传了 {\"warehouse_code\": 123}，仓号应当是字符串，就会触发校验异常。Agent 捕获后返回 invalid_input，提示输入没有通过契约校验，同样不会执行 Skill。额外传入未声明的参数也会被拒绝。\n所以，这个边界是靠运行时代码强制执行的，不只靠提示词约束模型。至于输出，分析结论和建议只用于展示，不能直接转成开风机、熏蒸等设备控制命令；当前项目也没有接入设备控制执行链路。", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "946dbded-a231-48e8-812f-656502d4361c:human:3"}, {"content": "当返回 `clarification_required` 后，如果用户下一轮补充了仓号，系统是怎么恢复刚才的 Skill 调用上下文，避免重新做一轮完整意图识别的？", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 625, "prompt_tokens": 3196, "total_tokens": 3821, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 584, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 625}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 2048, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 3196}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-max-0902", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-c27009f6-7ef3-992a-9172-388aa156b2a0", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a181c8-d0cb-7c63-a17a-0730c48a3b9b-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 3196, "output_tokens": 625, "total_tokens": 3821, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 2048}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 584}}}, {"content": "这个我不清楚", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "946dbded-a231-48e8-812f-656502d4361c:human:4"}, {"content": "没关系。我们转到你的多 Agent 面试系统。你提到用 LangGraph checkpoint 解决并发会话状态一致性，具体用什么作为会话隔离键？不同用户或不同面试场次之间是怎么保证不串状态的？", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 349, "prompt_tokens": 3251, "total_tokens": 3600, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 302, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 349}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 3072, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 3251}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-max-0902", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-d9fa7e3c-83b3-9376-ace5-96f1bad3a8e3", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a181c9-75d6-76f3-830e-1806021f49b8-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 3251, "output_tokens": 349, "total_tokens": 3600, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 3072}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 302}}}, {"content": "我为每一轮对话都设置一个uuid独立表示，然后跟checkpoint的config绑定，每次graph都会用config来绑定从而获取到独立的上下文", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "946dbded-a231-48e8-812f-656502d4361c:human:5"}, {"content": "这里先确认一个关键点：这个 uuid 是每一轮都新生成，还是整个面试会话复用？如果每轮都是新的，LangGraph 怎么读取上一轮的 checkpoint，面试状态又怎么延续？", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 401, "prompt_tokens": 3339, "total_tokens": 3740, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 355, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 401}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 3072, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 3339}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-max-0902", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-ea7041ba-a826-9a70-8ac7-83419815afe6", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a181ca-be31-7702-bcf4-5afbd8f05422-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 3339, "output_tokens": 401, "total_tokens": 3740, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 3072}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 355}}}, {"content": "一个页面使用的一个uuid，持续整个面试过程", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "946dbded-a231-48e8-812f-656502d4361c:human:6"}, {"content": "页面级 uuid 可以理解为会话的 `thread_id`。那如果同一个页面在短时间内触发了两个并发请求，比如用户连续点击“开始下一题”，你的 LangGraph 会怎么处理？会不会出现 checkpoint 覆盖或状态被重复推进？", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 237, "prompt_tokens": 3406, "total_tokens": 3643, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 183, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 237}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 3072, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 3406}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-max-0902", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-346f9363-0957-92f2-8f6f-7c05e5a34d34", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a181cb-75f4-70f2-ac8c-7b5faa12ff40-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 3406, "output_tokens": 237, "total_tokens": 3643, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 3072}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 183}}}, {"content": "这里所说的开始下一题是什么意思？因为我做的面试模拟类型的，相当于我俩在面试的时候，只会出现一问一答的情况", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "946dbded-a231-48e8-812f-656502d4361c:human:7"}, {"content": "我说的不是业务流程上的“下一题”，而是同一个页面会话的 `uuid/thread_id` 被重复触发。比如前端超时重试、用户刷新，导致两个请求带着同一个 `thread_id` 几乎同时进入 LangGraph。\n\n你有没有对同一个 `thread_id` 做过并发控制，比如锁、幂等或请求去重？如果没有，你觉得 checkpoint 会出现什么问题？", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 469, "prompt_tokens": 3496, "total_tokens": 3965, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 387, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 469}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 3072, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 3496}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-max-0902", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-0837b67d-5ed3-9a96-a531-fb38380c4ce3", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a181cc-46ae-72c0-b3a8-088a566b6f43-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 3496, "output_tokens": 469, "total_tokens": 3965, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 3072}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 387}}}, {"content": "我目前的并发针对多会话多，那么单会话的情况我还没整理", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "946dbded-a231-48e8-812f-656502d4361c:human:8"}, {"content": "那你说具体一点：你实际用的 checkpointer 是哪种？服务重启后，凭这个页面 uuid 还能恢复到上一轮面试状态吗？", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 1427, "prompt_tokens": 3604, "total_tokens": 5031, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 1393, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 1427}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 3072, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 3604}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-max-0902", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-fae79e01-f490-913b-8dce-e45955bb395c", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a181cd-1491-77c0-8af1-37a8e7b1bae7-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 3604, "output_tokens": 1427, "total_tokens": 5031, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 3072}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 1393}}}, {"content": "用的Inmemory，因此并不能在服务重启后直接回复，而是打算用保存历史信息的方式，用session id来表示已经存在的面试历史", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "946dbded-a231-48e8-812f-656502d4361c:human:9"}, {"content": "那你现在要区分两个概念：聊天历史和 LangGraph 的图状态。假设服务重启后，你用 session id 把历史消息恢复出来，但面试刚好进行到 Assess 节点，中间评估结果还没生成。你怎么知道应该从 Interview、Assess 还是 Evaluate 哪个节点继续？", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 314, "prompt_tokens": 3676, "total_tokens": 3990, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 249, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 314}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 3072, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 3676}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-max-0902", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-d837acd8-f834-910c-8ba5-d6236fc9c862", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a181ce-9ca1-7e53-bd5d-d3846d221941-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 3676, "output_tokens": 314, "total_tokens": 3990, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 3072}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 249}}}, {"content": "这里我不太清楚，还没做到", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "946dbded-a231-48e8-812f-656502d4361c:human:10"}, {"content": "可以理解，这块先放一边。回到你的面试系统：Interview、Assess、Evaluate 三个 Agent 之间传递的数据结构是什么？举一个实际例子，说明上一轮的输出如何变成下一个 Agent 的输入。", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 420, "prompt_tokens": 3759, "total_tokens": 4179, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 372, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 420}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 3072, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 3759}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-max-0902", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-a0de27f7-ae64-9b19-a30e-ae702916ae2a", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a181cf-169b-7972-a287-326310b20f05-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 3759, "output_tokens": 420, "total_tokens": 4179, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 3072}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 372}}}, {"content": "因为我用的langgraph，所以他们都是用langgraph里面的state来进行交流", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "946dbded-a231-48e8-812f-656502d4361c:human:11"}, {"content": "State 只是容器，关键是字段边界。你的共享 State 里具体有哪些字段？比如 Interview 节点写入的是原始回答，Assess 节点写入的是评分还是结构化评估结果？哪个节点能覆盖哪些字段，有没有做约束？", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 199, "prompt_tokens": 3832, "total_tokens": 4031, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 146, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 199}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 3072, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 3832}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-max-0902", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-af468d1d-ae63-9679-b5ac-b24e549c485c", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a181cf-f75c-7ab2-ace4-8978dbe6c7f0-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 3832, "output_tokens": 199, "total_tokens": 4031, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 3072}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 146}}}], "chat_round": 12, "candidate_config": {"language": "zh-CN", "education": "硕士", "position": "Agent应用开发工程师", "resume": "/Users/apple/program/ai-interview/src/data/swap/946dbded-a231-48e8-812f-656502d4361c/简历.pdf"}, "interviewer_config": {"role_identity": "技术面试官", "role_responsibilities": "围绕岗位要求与项目经历，逐步提问和追问。主要问技术实现细节而不是怎么做一个东西"}, "status": "active", "last_activity": 1793179260.843255, "resume_evalute": "**最重要**：附件为一份可读的简历（硕士在读候选人，面向 Agent/AI 应用开发方向），内容完整，以下为分析结论。\n\n1. **整体判断与简历重点**：候选人是一名以 LLM Agent 编排与工程落地为主线的在读硕士，能力集中在 LangGraph/LangChain 生态下的多 Agent 链路设计、Skill 受控调用与会话状态管理，最具说服力的证据是中储粮粮情分析实习中\"大模型输出不直接执行、用确定性程序兜底\"的边界设计，以及 EasyDict 开源修复中从 Issue 根因到回归验证的完整闭环；最值得深入讨论的也正是这两段。主要局限在于：实习全程使用\"参与\"表述，个人贡献与方案归属边界不清；核心个人项目 AI-Interview 仍标注\"开发中\"，其中 RAG 降 token、面试流程状态控制等关键项停留在问题描述层面；全文缺少上线规模、效果对比等量化结果，成果说服力有待面试确认。\n\n2. **技术栈与实践深度**：候选人的技术组合可归纳为\"Python + LangGraph/LangChain 多 Agent 编排 + FastAPI 等后端工程 + 受控执行设计\"。支撑较强的部分：实习中有 Agent 服务—业务服务—Skill 调用链打通、Pydantic 输入校验、SkillRegistry 白名单、固定执行器、skill-calls 调用留痕等具体方案；AI-Interview 中有 Interview/Assess/Evaluate 三 Agent 分工、Agent 间输入输出协议、流式接口、以及用 LangGraph checkpoint 解决并发会话状态一致性的描述，并能指出\"LangGraph 短期记忆底层仍全量传递 message\"这类机制层问题，说明对框架的理解超出调用层面。支撑较弱的部分：LangSmith\"熟练使用\"无任何场景展开；RAG 仅作为 token 优化方向被提及，无实现方案与效果数据；dify、Vue、Django、Swift 等为技能栏罗列。EasyDict 贡献（Issue #1217、AXWindow 焦点角色根因、Text Marker 兜底、回归清单）是简历中证据链最完整的个人技术产出，但体量属兼容性修复，且只写\"提交 PR\"未写明是否被合并。整体看，LangGraph 编排—Skill 受控调用—状态持久化—审计追溯在两段经历中互相印证，构成连贯实践链路，而非关键词堆砌；CCF-C 论文、PRICAI 审稿与数学建模国三等奖支撑研究与英文文档能力，与 Agent 开发岗位直接关联较弱。\n\n3. **经历的突出程度**：粮情分析实习的价值在于问题本身：企业场景中\"大模型能理解意图但输出不可直接执行\"，方案用白名单、固定执行器、关键信息缺失时返回澄清而非执行、调用记录留痕等手段保证可复现与可审计，这是企业级 Agent 落地的真实难点，表述已具备\"难点—取舍—验证\"结构，明显优于单纯的功能罗列。不足是全部动作以\"参与\"描述（参与调用链打通、参与数据契约设计、参与联调验收），无法判断受控执行方案由谁提出、他实现到哪一层，也没有交付规模、验收结论或上线后使用情况等结果证据，且实习期约四个月，责任深度天然受限。EasyDict 贡献的亮点是独立闭环：在陌生代码库中复现问题、定位 Accessibility 根因、设计不影响通用路径的内核专属取词路径并逐项回归，个人贡献清晰、过程可通过 Issue 号核验；不足是修复类贡献复杂度有限、PR 合并状态未写明。AI-Interview 目前更多支撑其问题定义能力（并发状态一致性、token 负担、流程错乱三个难点抓得准），但因项目在开发中、解法未落地呈现，暂不能支撑交付能力结论。\n\n4. **岗位匹配判断**：仅依据岗位名称\"Agent应用开发工程师\"判断，未提供具体 JD，以下按该岗位一般职责（Agent 编排与开发、工具/Skill 调用、LLM 应用工程化、状态与记忆管理、可靠性与可审计）比较。定性结论：**较匹配**。最强匹配点是有经历支持的 Agent 工程实践：实习直接负责过 Agent 服务与业务 Skill 调用链研发，受控执行与审计设计与企业 Agent 岗位的核心关注高度一致；个人项目覆盖多 Agent 分工、会话持久化、流式接口等典型工程主题；开源贡献佐证调试与回归素养。主要差距：简历未体现 Agent 效果评估与观测实践（LangSmith 仅自述）、无生产环境并发与规模经验、RAG/记忆优化未经实现验证，这些是 Agent 岗位常见要求而证据不足。待确认信息：若目标岗位偏模型侧（微调、评测集建设）或要求特定业务域经验，简历未覆盖，属信息缺失而非已证能力不足。可迁移能力包括陌生代码库根因定位、兼容性设计、英文论文与文档阅读。\n\n5. **面试验证重点**：\n- **实习方案归属与个人边界**：请候选人复现受控执行链路的设计理由（为何白名单+固定执行器、Pydantic 校验边界如何划定、澄清策略谁定义），并说明自己在联调验收中的具体产出。验证结果决定\"受控执行与审计设计\"这一核心亮点按个人能力还是团队方案执行来计权。\n- **LangGraph 实践深度与在开发项目落地度**：围绕 checkpoint 追问具体用法（checkpointer 选型、会话隔离键、并发冲突与重复提交下的恢复行为），以及 RAG 降 token 方案是否已实现、有无前后成本或效果对比。验证结果影响对其编排能力\"会调用\"还是\"懂机制、能做取舍\"的判断。\n- **EasyDict PR 状态与调试过程**：确认 PR 是否被合并、如何定位 AXWindow 焦点角色（复现路径与调试工具）、为何选择 Text Marker 兜底且不影响通用路径。验证结果影响简历中最清晰的个人贡献证据的真实性与独立性认定。"}, "next": [], "config": {"configurable": {"thread_id": "946dbded-a231-48e8-812f-656502d4361c", "checkpoint_ns": "", "checkpoint_id": "1f1d2b0e-41df-6bae-8032-a0fa80aba80c"}}, "metadata": {"source": "update", "step": 50, "parents": {}}, "created_at": "2026-10-28T09:21:00.844293+00:00", "parent_config": {"configurable": {"thread_id": "946dbded-a231-48e8-812f-656502d4361c", "checkpoint_ns": "", "checkpoint_id": "1f1d2b0e-41d7-6b3e-8031-a306105db797"}}, "tasks": [], "interrupts": []}